*> Test of combat 4.5 (17 section 4.5, 8): armor and toughness (CombatRules.getDamageAfterAbsorb), Breach, armor wear.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-TOOL-COMBAT-4-5.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-I1 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I2 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I3 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I4 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I5 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I6 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I7 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I8 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I9 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I10 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I11 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I12 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I13 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I14 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I15 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I16 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-T1 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-T2 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-T3 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-O1 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O2 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O3 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O4 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O5 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O6 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X1 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-X2 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-X3 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-OBS PIC X(240).
 01 WS-E1 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E2 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E3 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E4 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E5 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E6 PIC -(9)9.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "acceptance US14 armor 10 toughness 0 against 10.0: f 2, e 5, q 0.2, result 8.0; full diamond (20, toughness 8) against 20.0: 8.0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 10 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I4
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-ABSORB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 20000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 20 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 8000 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I4
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-ABSORB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "8000 8000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 armor never removes more than 80 percent, and a huge hit is still reduced by at least 20 percent of the armor: armor 20 against 100.0 gives 84.0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 100000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 20 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I4
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-ABSORB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 20 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I4
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-ABSORB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "84000 220" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 no armor leaves the damage; Breach II lowers the armor effectiveness by 0.30 (q 0.2 - 0.3 floors at 0: 10.0 stays 10.0; full diamond with Breach I gives 11.0)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I4
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-ABSORB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 10 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 2 TO WS-I4
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-ABSORB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 20000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 20 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 8000 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I4
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-ABSORB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "10000 10000 11000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 armor wear: each of the four pieces takes max(1, floor(damage / 4)) unless the source bypasses armor" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 8000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-WEAR" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-WEAR" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 9999 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-WEAR" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 8000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-WEAR" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "2 1 2 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     STOP RUN.

 ADD-OBS.
     IF TL-OBSERVED = SPACES
         MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBS) TO TL-OBSERVED
     ELSE
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBS) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF.

 CHECK-DONE.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM TEST-TOOL-COMBAT-4-5.
